{
  "$schema": "../protocol.schema.json",
  "component": "Checkbox",
  "protocol": 1,
  "status": "draft",
  "summary": "复选框。原生 input 承担全部语义与键盘行为，视觉方框是独立部件；勾选与半选由根节点的 data-state 表达。",
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "class": "sm-checkbox",
      "tag": "label",
      "required": true,
      "data": {
        "state": {
          "kind": "state",
          "domain": "selection",
          "enum": [
            "checked",
            "unchecked",
            "indeterminate"
          ],
          "required": true,
          "default": "unchecked"
        },
        "disabled": {
          "kind": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "interaction": [
        "hover",
        "focus-within"
      ]
    },
    "parts": {
      "control": {
        "class": "sm-checkbox__control",
        "tag": "span",
        "required": true,
        "order": 1,
        "notes": "16×16 的定位容器，input 绝对定位在其中，视觉方框也在里面。勾号由样式层绘制。",
        "requires": {
          "inside": "root",
          "lane": {
            "name": "root-row",
            "order": 1
          },
          "parent": {
            "layout": "flex-row"
          }
        }
      },
      "input": {
        "class": "sm-checkbox__input",
        "tag": "input",
        "required": true,
        "order": 1,
        "attrs": {
          "type": {
            "required": true,
            "default": "checkbox"
          }
        },
        "notes": "视觉上不可见但必须可聚焦；indeterminate 是 JS 属性，不体现在 attribute 上。",
        "requires": {
          "inside": "control",
          "lane": {
            "name": "control-row",
            "order": 1
          },
          "parent": {
            "layout": "block"
          }
        }
      },
      "box": {
        "class": "sm-checkbox__box",
        "tag": "span",
        "required": true,
        "order": 2,
        "aria": {
          "aria-hidden": "true"
        },
        "notes": "纯视觉方框。勾号与半选横线由样式层绘制，不占用 DOM。",
        "requires": {
          "inside": "control",
          "lane": {
            "name": "control-row",
            "order": 2
          },
          "parent": {
            "layout": "block"
          }
        }
      },
      "label": {
        "class": "sm-checkbox__label",
        "tag": "span",
        "required": false,
        "order": 2,
        "condition": "存在文本内容",
        "requires": {
          "inside": "root",
          "lane": {
            "name": "root-row",
            "order": 2
          },
          "parent": {
            "layout": "flex-row"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "invariants": [
    "根节点必须是 label，且恰好包含一个 type=checkbox 的原生 input。",
    "control 必须是 root 的直接子节点；input 与 box 必须是 control 的直接子节点，且 input 在 box 之前。",
    "data-state 必须与 input 的真实状态一致：checked 对应 checked 属性，indeterminate 对应 input.indeterminate 属性。",
    "indeterminate 时 input 仍可被点击，点击后回到 checked / unchecked——状态机由使用者决定。",
    "disabled 时 input 必须带原生 disabled，且根节点同时带 data-disabled。",
    "box 必须 aria-hidden，不得作为可访问名称的来源。",
    "label 若存在，必须是 root 的直接子节点，且位于 control 之后。",
    "禁止用 div + 图标模拟复选框；键盘与表单行为必须由原生 input 提供。"
  ],
  "a11y": [
    "可访问名称来自 label 文本或 aria-label，不能只靠视觉方框。",
    "焦点环必须由 input 的 :focus-visible 驱动，样式作用在 box 上（相邻兄弟选择器）。",
    "半选状态必须通过 input.indeterminate = true 告知辅助技术，仅改 data-state 不够。"
  ],
  "notes": "data-state 使用 STATE-VOCAB 的 selection 值域（checked / unchecked / indeterminate），这是该值域第一次被组件使用。"
}
